{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "10ea8ac7-0fce-426e-807f-ed7bce74db66",
    "name": "📌 Meta Model API",
    "description": "### About\n\n\"Explore AI at Meta. Meet Muse, our new AI agent that takes tasks off your plate. Use Meta AI for questions and images, plus tools for developers.\"\n\nMeta builds its own Muse models and serves them through OpenAI-compatible Chat and Responses APIs and an Anthropic-compatible Messages API. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Model makers**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Meta AI Account: [https://dev.meta.ai/](https://dev.meta.ai/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `meta_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:meta_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://dev.meta.ai/docs/getting-started/overview](https://dev.meta.ai/docs/getting-started/overview/)\n    \n- Models: [https://dev.meta.ai/docs/getting-started/models](https://dev.meta.ai/docs/getting-started/models)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-07-11T15:25:33.000Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-17T03:38:56.000Z",
